],
"itemCornerRadius": 0,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- Layout and icon adjustments for each page.\n- Automatic widget positioning and compatibility.\n- Automatically saves icon state.\n- Customize icon columns/rows and icon scale.\n- Customize widget icon scale.\n- Customize page margins (left, right, top, bottom).\n- Customize page and widget spacing.\n- Enable/Disable App Library.\n- Hide notification badges, labels, page dots and blur folder icons.\n- Show a blur layer behind icons.\n- Customize page label display and the Welcome message.\n- Customize page dot position.\n- Export and import saved presets.\n- And many more options.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
